{"title": "Drunk (Drunken Master) (Condition)", "pageid": 51332, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Drunk_(Drunken_Master)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\">Drunk (Condition)</a>        </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Drunk</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Although drunk, you are immune to the negative effects of alcohol, thanks to your training in the <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Drunken_Master\" title=\"Way of the Drunken Master\">Way of the Drunken Master</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DRUNK_DRUNKEN_MASTER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDRUNK_DRUNKEN_MASTER%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDRUNK_DRUNKEN_MASTER%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheeky_Tipple\" title=\"Cheeky Tipple\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/20px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/30px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/40px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cheeky Tipple\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/20px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cheeky_Tipple\" title=\"Cheeky Tipple\">Cheeky Tipple</a> will remove any other drunk condition such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Alcohol</a> and apply this condition for 5 turns. This duration does not depend on the duration of the replaced drunk condition.</li>\n<li>This condition triggers the effects of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\">Punch-Drunk Bastard</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\">Drunken Cloth</a>, and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Drunkard\" title=\"Amulet of the Drunkard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Drunkard\" title=\"Amulet of the Drunkard\">Amulet of the Drunkard</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Drunk\">Sources of Drunk</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheeky_Tipple\" title=\"Cheeky Tipple\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/30px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/45px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/60px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cheeky Tipple\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/30px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cheeky_Tipple\" title=\"Cheeky Tipple\">Cheeky Tipple</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201934\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [